Error: Jet.MarkerArgumentMismatch: `#Rename` arguments do not match `Rename(name: NamingCase | String, args: String{none}, env: String{none}, db: String{none}, layout: String{none})` or a format label
  --> Tests/UI/serde_rename_unknown_format.jet:3:6
    |
  3 |     #Rename(name: "who", msgpak: "w") who: String,
    |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Beside its parameters, `#Rename` takes one label per codec format, the `name` of a `Format` impl: json, cbor, csv, toml, yaml, xml
 Fix: Match `Rename(name: NamingCase | String, args: String{none}, env: String{none}, db: String{none}, layout: String{none})`, label a format once, or import the package that implements the format
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.MarkerArgumentMismatch
